# The firmware images are the manufacturer's and are never committed. MoonVerb loads them at run time
# from a folder you point it at; tests read them from $MOONVERB_ROMS, outside the repository. Only their
# SHA-256 hashes are in the source.
*.bin
*.BIN
*.rom
*.syx
*.mid
# ...nor any recording or impulse response of the unit.
*.wav
*.f64
